tive Lamar Hunt Trophy as AFC champions, and made a third-straight Super Bowl appearance. The remarkable run builds upon nearly a decade of tremendous success, during which the team made the playoffs every year (2015-24), won the AFC West Division title nine years running (2016-24), appeared in the AFC Championship Game seven years in a row (2018-24), and ultimately made five Super Bowl appearances over the past six years, raising the hallowed Vince Lombardi Trophy three times.","release_date":"2025-08-14","title_id":13237,"created_at":"2025-09-13T23:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:37:14.000000Z","release_date_it":"2025-08-14","translations":[{"id":276083,"translatable_type":"season","translatable_id":7578,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Stagione 1"},{"id":276084,"translatable_type":"season","translatable_id":7578,"locale":"it","key":"release_date","value":"2025-08-14"}],"episodes":[{"id":95230,"number":1,"name":"Episodio 1","plot":"Dietro Patrick Mahomes, il cui percorso dal figlio di un giocatore di baseball a quarterback superstar è già leggendario, i Chiefs - una delle franchigie più storiche della NFL - avviano la loro corsa per un terzo titolo consecutivo al Super Bowl. Ma una serie di infortuni minaccia il loro forte inizio di stagione 2024 e solleva serie preoccupazioni sulla difficile strada che li attende.","duration":54,"scws_id":338303,"season_id":7578,"created_at":"2025-09-13T23:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:54.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-14 01:24:30","images":[{"id":218345,"filename":"c772707f-1048-4bd3-82ed-8285807c2f13.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":95230,"created_at":"2025-09-13T23:24:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T23:24:31.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/c772707f-1048-4bd3-82ed-8285807c2f13.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":276089,"translatable_type":"e